Created Apr 22, 2022, 12:33AM::md.update
Summary::md.summary
  Me and jeff were talking and one thing we seized upon are that variables and macros are way too disconnected.

  One of the things that came up is that each macro could have one macro-local variable that you can adjust inline in your macro panel. This would be useful for like booleans and power attack and stuff.
